1. WHAT YOU CAN DO, FOR FREE
   a. Play yeet2waifu on your streams and in your videos, including monetized ones, by running it from the
      official site in a browser or as an OBS Browser Source: https://haruwelkins.github.io/yeet2waifu/
   b. Record, clip and share footage of the game, as long as the in game credit ("yeet2waifu by:@haru717171x")
      stays visible and unaltered.
   c. Draw your own waifus in the editor and share their waifu codes. The waifus you draw are yours.
   d. Share links to the official site.

